    "B": {"adequacy": 3, "critical_unsupported": 1, "critical_omission": 1, "wrong_unit_qualifier": 0, "entity_relation": 1, "fluency": 2, "utility": 3, "evidence": ["이란 정부와 국민들을 향해 연일 아버지의 “복수”를 호소해서다", "이란 언론은 제납의 이런 모습을 부각시키고 있다"], "reason": "It says Iranian media are appealing for revenge, but in the source it is Zeinab who appeals and the media only highlight her. This reverses the actor. The quotes from the speech are accurate, but the summary omits the funeral setting and the threat against US troops. The first sentence is repetitive."},
